<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wiser to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wiser to hold.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies and Co Inc cut its rating for the Wiser Oil Co to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Jefferies cited lower than expected second quarter results due to lower production levels and higher costs.</p>
<p>-- We are also lowering our earnings and cash flow estimates for 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Wiser reported a loss of $0.22 per share for the second quarter compared with recurring earnings of $0.10 for Q2 1996 and materially lower than Jefferies' earnings estimate of $0.18 per share.</p>
</text>
